              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩngũseũvya kyeni, na ngyũmba kĩvindu; nĩngũseũvya mũuo, na ngyũmba ũthũku; ninyie Yeova, ũla wĩkaa maũndũ asu onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.7"
