        },
        {
          "text": "Volotangai, inyw’ĩ matu, kuma ĩũlũ, na mathweo metĩkye ũlũngalu: nthĩ ĩvingũke, nĩ kana ĩetae ũtangĩĩo, na yumĩlye ũlũngalu vamwe; nyie, Yeova, nĩnĩmĩtw’ĩkĩthĩtye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
