          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeova, Ũla Mũtheu wa Isilaeli, na nĩwe Mũmbi wake, easya atĩĩ: Ngũlyai ũndũ wa maũndũ ala mokĩte; ĩndaĩei ũndũ wa ana makwa, na ũndũ wa wĩa wa moko makwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
