          "text": "Ndyaaneenea kĩmbithĩnĩ, vandũ va nthĩ ve kĩvindu; ndyaatavya ũsyao wa Yakovo, Manthai nyie mana: nyie, Yeova, nĩneenaa ũlũngalu, nĩtavanasya maũndũ ma w’o. ",
